group_members.description:
Members list — ports (``"53"``, ``"9000-9010"``) for
port-groups; IPv4 addresses / CIDR blocks for address-groups;
IPv6 for ipv6-address-groups.

interval.description:
Rollup granularity — "5minutes", "hourly", "daily",
or "monthly" (5-minute archives are retained briefly;
hourly/daily reach back much further)
